OL,4,BLeague Two footballer charged with rape
OL,5,GLeague Two footballer Isiah Noel-      
OL,6,GWilliams has been charged with rape.   
OL,8,FNoel-Williams, who plays for League    
OL,9,FTwo side Barnet, has been charged with 
OL,10,Fthree counts of rape and one count of  
OL,11,Fsexual assault by penetration,         
OL,12,FHertfordshire Police said.             
OL,14,FThe 23-year-old, of High Oaks, St      
OL,15,FAlbans, was remanded in custody        
OL,16,Ffollowing a hearing at Hatfield        
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court on Saturday.        
